      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Is it safer to move your hole arm instead of your wrist with these? I usually do that to get more control with the movement.\n\nDo you have any suggestions for alternative gestures? The fingers must be visible to the headset cameras from multiple angles for them to work well, I think that's part of the reason these gestures were chosen.\n\nYou might also want to poke Meta about this, the Horizon OS hand tracking quick menu also requires you do this kind of gesture.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
